Dear[SPC]
Player
You have[SPC]
[SPC]days to solve this problem.
Yours sincerely,
This property is beyond repair.  Get out quickly.
In order to repair your fence as well as your building, it will now cost ${N}.[CR][CR]Do you want to do it?
Your property is in perfect condition and doesn't need repairing.
This is an emergency repair and very expensive.  It will cost ${N} and rising...[CR][CR]Are you sure you want to?
Due to your building being infested, this repair will cost you ${N} and rising...[CR][CR]Are you sure you want to?
Your sewage pipes are ruptured badly.  Do you want me to try and fix the damage?


One of your buildings has started to deteriorate, either do a manual repair to it or send a Fixer round.  Jump straight to the building by clicking on the Arrow icon.


{I}
[CEN]TAX BILL NOW DUE![CR][CR] $[WHTFG]{N}[COLR] is now due. Go to City Hall to pay it now before it accrues interest.
