Overcrowding will soon occur of {W}. Stop production now.
You were warned about over producing {W}.  When Cousin Luigi has finished, more children won't be a problem.


City Hall will not allow you to buy more land until building standards are improved. You are only making use of {N}% of your available land.
Until you improve the building layout on [WHTFG]{B} Estate[COLR], City Hall refuses to let you buy more land.
You cannot purchase any more Estates while [WHTFG]{B} Estate[COLR] remains empty.
As you have not paid your overdue tax, City Hall will not allow you to buy any more Estates.


{H}I asked you time and time again but in the end I had to complain to City Hall.  Maybe you'll listen to me next time.
[REDBG][SPC]Tenant left due to complaint not being solved.[SPC]
{H}I'm sick of having to walk everywhere.  Start putting some Subway sites closer to make my life easier or you don't get any rent off me.{T}
{H}HELP!!  I can't see anything for the smoke in here.{T}
{H}HELP!!  That guy next door has got a problem with his house. It's on fire.  Do something 'cause I don't want my kids getting burnt.{T}
{H}Your factory has been going day and night.  I can't stand the noise anymore.  Close it down or give me something to block out the noise.{T}
{H}Y'know, I really think that commie next-door needs his fence 'trimming', I am going to get my Uncle Vito to come and see to it, unless my rent goes down dramatically.{T}
{H}This place is like O'Flannagan's bar on a Saturday night, loud explosions and people gettin killed everywhere, install some thick curtains immediately to block out the noise.{T}
{H}Look what's been done to my fence.  I need it repaired now.{T}
{H}I've seen some nasty undesirable types wandering around this estate.  My kids might get into trouble and hurt themselves.{T}
{H}I have seen an eight foot high cockroach in the garden of a neighbors house.  HELP!{T}
{H}I'm not having those noisy builders digging up my garden all day and night whilst I'm around.  You can hardly hear yourself think when they start up.{T}


This house is way below my standards.  I would hate to reside in such a common house.  Do I have to?
If you force me to live here you'll regret it. Are you sure you want me to?
I can't carry out my work in a building like this. Are you sure you want me to live here?
You've got to be kidding, no way will I live in that house unless you force me.
In my day they built better cardboard boxes than this. You aren't serious about me living here?
This house is a dump. What happened to building regulations when this was constructed. Do I have to live here?
I may have simple tastes but even I have some standards. You really expect me to live here?
This place looks like it's already been vandalized.  What's left for me to do to it!  Must I live here?
I don't like the idea of living here.  Are you sure you want me to?
This doesn't look like my sort of house.  Are you sure?
We're not living anywhere near weirdoes.  If you get rid of them we might reconsider.
That house is definitely unsuitable for us in its current condition.
*Tenant has died of old age!
One of your Tenants has died of old age and you have none left to replace him.  You can view the house by clicking on the arrow.
*Tenant has left due to stress...
*I've gone to the cemetery to see Uncle Vincent
*Work unable to continue due to Tenant
*I'm off to work, see you this evening
*I'm off for my Hospital appointment
*I'm quickly cleaning up the yard 
The tenant is too stressed to think about having kids at the moment.
We will not move into a house that is in that condition with cockroaches everywhere.
We have decided to defect to your family because of our bad treatment by our old family.  So here's a house for free!!!


*I'm tired.  I'm off to get some sleep...
*I'm no longer needed so I'm going home.
*It's so easy...
*There is nothing left to steal...
*Those resources are not yet available


