When are you going to learn to do as you're told?  You were supposed to kidnap Frankie, not murder the punk.  If the Don had a kinder side to him he might have let this 'oversight' go unpunished.
Not quite got the hang of this yet have you?  The Don said he wanted you to kidnap Frankie.  But what do you do - take over his stinking house.  The Don wants you to know that he's not pleased.
Do you know how to read?  When the Don sends you a message telling you to kidnap Frankie then that's what he means, not go mad and destroy the punk's two-bit empire.  In a hurry to know what the Don is like when he's unhappy?  Because you're going to find out real soon.
Wondering why it's so quiet?  It might have something to do with you wiping everyone out.  Did the Don tell you to do that?  No, he didn't.  He did ask you to do other things though for him, important things and now you can't do them.  Do you think the Don's pleased with you?  You're going to find out just how he feels anytime now. 
Trying something new like thinking for yourself?  The Don didn't tell you to take over or destroy Lenny's place yet.  So the Don has decided to do a little thinking of his own and you ain't going to like what he thinks about you.
You were NOT told by the Don to attack this house!  You seem to think you know better than the Don - you can pay your respects to the others who thought that way the next time you go fishing.  Carry on this way and you're really going to regret it.
Hey trigger-happy.  You don't want to whack this person yet.  His family are real close to the Don and asked for him to be left alone - that means don't kill him....Well not yet anyway. 
#Police Interest
Do you know what Joey's secret weapon is?  The Don made it plain enough when he told you what to do, so why upset the Don and kill Joey before you get your hands on it?  The Don is really angry and you're going to find out just how much.
The Don's cousin comes to town, wanders around, sees a few of the sites and samples some local delicacies.  Then what happens?  You go and let him get killed.  I wouldn't want to be in your shoes when the Don finds out!
